\"T-076-22\",\"attempt\":\"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef\",\"session\":\"08e0a52d-e566-41bf-98ec-fb1b2665b38c\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/a2a-t076-real-delivery-02/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/a2a-t076-real-delivery-02/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-076-22' '--attempt' '1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef' '--session' '08e0a52d-e566-41bf-98ec-fb1b2665b38c' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":23,"time":"2026-10-13T14:57:04.238Z","task":"T-076-22","attempt":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"T-076-22","attempt_id":"1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","session_id":"08e0a52d-e566-41bf-98ec-fb1b2665b38c","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"0b37bc2d-40f8-4d4c-bdc2-dbc43ddca2e7","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"4724ea5e-94f0-4c69-ace9-3f803b8ed626","thread":"0b37bc2d-40f8-4d4c-bdc2-dbc43ddca2e7","shell_pid":98829,"leader_pid":98831,"native_session":null},"workspace":"/private/tmp/a2a-t076-real-delivery-02/state/worktrees/1d38e368-8d2b-4909-8a53-cd4c329691ef","base_commit":"29d45fbd701a95ac7d309aeedbf16a39096384ea","card_snapshot_id":"5a5eac7d-ae34-43d9-b780-3b12772d9ec7","reclaimed":false,"owner":"T-076-22","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-13T14:58:50.453Z","task":"T-076-22","attempt